{"id":"5111035a66b30703","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","title":"欧氏空间的 Borel 测度与限制数据","display":"df-euclidean-lebesgue-data — 欧氏空间的 Borel 测度与限制数据","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data","aliases":["58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data"],"display":"df-euclidean-lebesgue-data — 欧氏空间的 Borel 测度与限制数据","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-euclidean-lebesgue-data — 欧氏空间的 Borel 测度与限制数据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md\">../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 为有限函数空间。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_n=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)\">\\(\\tau_n=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R^n}(\\tau_n)\">\\(\\mathcal B_n=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R^n}(\\tau_n)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)&lt;b(i))\">\\(\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)&lt;b(i))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Box}_n(a,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{Box}_n(a,b)\\)</span> 为下式给出的开矩形。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{i\\in\\varnothing}r_i=1\">\\(\\prod_{i\\in\\varnothing}r_i=1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\langle A,c\\rangle\">\\(z=\\langle A,c\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0(z)=A\">\\(\\pi_0(z)=A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(z)=c\">\\(\\pi_1(z)=c\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\inf\\varnothing=\\infty\">\\(\\inf\\varnothing=\\infty\\)</span>，和为非负扩展实数和。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_n^*\">\\(\\lambda_n^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_n\">\\(\\lambda_n\\)</span> 由下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_n\">\\(\\lambda_n\\)</span> 在 Borel 集上取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^n\">\\(\\lambda^n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{\\mathbb R^n}\">\\(\\lambda_{\\mathbb R^n}\\)</span> 在调用本文件的欧氏分析环境中均缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_n\">\\(\\lambda_n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\mathcal B_n\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\mathcal B_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Omega=\\{A\\cap\\Omega:A\\in\\mathcal B_n\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Omega=\\{A\\cap\\Omega:A\\in\\mathcal B_n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_\\Omega\">\\(\\lambda_\\Omega\\)</span> 为下式的限制图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)=\\mathcal B_n\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)=\\mathcal B_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}=\\tau_n\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}=\\tau_n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}rational\\text{-}boxes}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Box}_n(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)&lt;x(i)&lt;b(i))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}rational\\text{-}boxes}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Box}_n(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)&lt;x(i)&lt;b(i))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}box\\text{-}costs}\\vdash\n\\mathcal Q_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0\\rangle\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\operatorname{Box}_n(a,b),\\prod_{i\\in n}(b(i)-a(i))\\rangle:\na,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)&lt;b(i))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}box\\text{-}costs}\\vdash\n\\mathcal Q_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0\\rangle\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\operatorname{Box}_n(a,b),\\prod_{i\\in n}(b(i)-a(i))\\rangle:\na,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)&lt;b(i))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}outer}\\vdash\n\\lambda_n^*(A)\\coloneqq\\inf\\left\\{\n\\sum_{j\\in\\omega}\\pi_1(Q(j)):Q\\in\\mathcal Q_n^\\omega\\land\nA\\subseteq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\pi_0(Q(j))\\right\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}outer}\\vdash\n\\lambda_n^*(A)\\coloneqq\\inf\\left\\{\n\\sum_{j\\in\\omega}\\pi_1(Q(j)):Q\\in\\mathcal Q_n^\\omega\\land\nA\\subseteq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\pi_0(Q(j))\\right\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}borel}\\vdash\n\\lambda_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,\\lambda_n^*(A)\\rangle:A\\in\\mathcal B_n\\},\\qquad\n\\lambda_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,\\lambda_n(A)\\rangle:A\\in\\mathcal B_\\Omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}borel}\\vdash\n\\lambda_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,\\lambda_n^*(A)\\rangle:A\\in\\mathcal B_n\\},\\qquad\n\\lambda_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,\\lambda_n(A)\\rangle:A\\in\\mathcal B_\\Omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零维空间的唯一点有测度 1；空矩形的零费用允许覆盖序列补零。限制测度与 Borel 集族由 Ω 唯一确定，不是可任意重选的测度参数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md","status":"resolved","id":"e03c77e7d23896d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_n=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(\\mathbb R^n,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n=\\sigma_{\\mathbb R^n}(\\tau_n)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)<b(i))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Box}_n(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{i\\in\\varnothing}r_i=1","display":false},{"tex":"z=\\langle A,c\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0(z)=A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1(z)=c","display":false},{"tex":"\\inf\\varnothing=\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_n^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_{\\mathbb R^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_\\Omega=\\{A\\cap\\Omega:A\\in\\mathcal B_n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^n)=\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}=\\tau_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}rational\\text{-}boxes}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Box}_n(a,b)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)<x(i)<b(i))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}box\\text{-}costs}\\vdash\n\\mathcal Q_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\varnothing,0\\rangle\\}\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\operatorname{Box}_n(a,b),\\prod_{i\\in n}(b(i)-a(i))\\rangle:\na,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)<b(i))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}outer}\\vdash\n\\lambda_n^*(A)\\coloneqq\\inf\\left\\{\n\\sum_{j\\in\\omega}\\pi_1(Q(j)):Q\\in\\mathcal Q_n^\\omega\\land\nA\\subseteq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\omega}\\pi_0(Q(j))\\right\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}borel}\\vdash\n\\lambda_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,\\lambda_n^*(A)\\rangle:A\\in\\mathcal B_n\\},\\qquad\n\\lambda_\\Omega\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,\\lambda_n(A)\\rangle:A\\in\\mathcal B_\\Omega\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2345,"backlinks":[{"id":"70a18be302d94faf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ef06f79774aa2541","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"70d7a97bd7315c54","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d7bfcf5788937844","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"83e0b1063552231c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega$，$\\Omega\\in\\tau_n$；$\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega$ 使用 [[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]。"},{"id":"e5a0510b115e1b59","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d47484adcb88c697","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}=\\tau_n$、$\\mathcal B_\\Omega$、$\\lambda_\\Omega$ 使用 [[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]] 的固定欧氏 Borel 数据，不能在同一公式中重新选择。"},{"id":"c24c7e81186cbc4b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-496","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md|58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["ca7fc3ab38a11801","e03c77e7d23896d9"]}